{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q10329187","formula":"C₅H₁₀","hill":"C5H10","elements":["H","C"],"composition":{"C":5.0,"H":10.0},"names":{"en":"Methylcyclobutane","ru":"Метилциклобутан"},"descriptions":{"en":"Methylcyclobutane is an organic compound with the chemical formula C5H10. This is a cycloalkane consisting of a four-membered cyclobutane core substituted with a methyl group. It is a colorless, volatile liquid at room temperature and is primarily of interest in fundamental organic chemistry research, particularly in studies of ring strain and reaction mechanisms.","ru":"Метилциклобутан — органическое соединение, циклоалкан с химической формулой C5H10. Молекула состоит из циклобутанового кольца к которому прикреплён метильный заместитель. При комнатной температуре является бесцветной летучей жидкостью."},"fame":7,"pubchemCid":11725,"mass":70.13,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC1CCC1","inchikey":"BDJAEZRIGNCQBZ-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"methylcyclobutane","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"11725","atoms":15,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-0.527,"y":0.001,"z":0.439,"el":"C"},{"x":0.441,"y":1.064,"z":-0.121,"el":"C"},{"x":0.439,"y":-1.064,"z":-0.121,"el":"C"},{"x":1.552,"y":-0.001,"z":-0.011,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.904,"y":0.0,"z":-0.186,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.569,"y":0.001,"z":1.537,"el":"H"},{"x":0.578,"y":1.954,"z":0.497,"el":"H"},{"x":0.237,"y":1.376,"z":-1.153,"el":"H"},{"x":0.235,"y":-1.376,"z":-1.152,"el":"H"},{"x":0.575,"y":-1.954,"z":0.498,"el":"H"},{"x":2.293,"y":-0.001,"z":-0.814,"el":"H"},{"x":2.069,"y":-0.001,"z":0.956,"el":"H"},{"x":-2.469,"y":0.884,"z":0.127,"el":"H"},{"x":-2.469,"y":-0.884,"z":0.127,"el":"H"},{"x":-1.859,"y":0.0,"z":-1.28,"el":"H"}],"bonds":[[0,1,1],[0,2,1],[0,4,1],[0,5,1],[1,3,1],[1,6,1],[1,7,1],[2,3,1],[2,8,1],[2,9,1],[3,10,1],[3,11,1],[4,1